            "step_number": 3,
            "title": "حساب التكامل",
            "explanation": "\\[A=\\int_0^1\\frac{\\ln(x+1)}{x+1}dx.\\]\nنضع \\(u=\\ln(x+1)\\)، فيكون \\(du=\\frac{dx}{x+1}\\). إذن:\n\\[A=\\left[\\frac12(\\ln(x+1))^2\\right]_0^1.\\]",
            "result": "\\(A=\\frac12(\\ln2)^2\\)."
